  "sourceAssessment": {
    "basis": [
      "jinshu:053:s0068 explicitly names 治書御史劉振持節 guarding the deposed crown prince in 許昌, after Dan escorts him with a thousand troops. zizhitongjian:083:s0206 repeats the same Dan/thousand-troop transfer, 許昌宮,御史劉振 and credentialed guard duty. Full name plus identical prisoner, place, transfer and office establish one jailer.",
      "jinshu:053:s0122 and zizhitongjian:083:s0239 give the same named 劉振 taking Sun Lü’s report, moving the prince to 小坊 and cutting off food while palace personnel pass food over the wall. jinshu:053:s0131 and zizhitongjian:083:s0274 then both list 劉振、孫慮、程據 among those executed at Jia’s fall. This distinctive action and fate bridge confirms the same person throughout."
    ],
    "notes": [
      "All103 Chinese units/eight complete governing blocks, both full singleton records,12 claims and13 mentions read; both English fields at all6owned anchors. Source106’s longer Supervising Secretary Liu Zhen mention in s0068 is correctly owned by the same p055.",
      "The printed 治書御史 versus 持書御史 and differing English office renderings are preserved as supplied witnesses. The exact matching guard and deprivation episodes establish identity without inventing an office alias or philological emendation. Existing AD300 attestations/death, official role, male sex and polity hints remain unchanged.",
      "Fresh ordinary model merge covers the single current pair and both full members. No source/English/extraction/date change, outsidechapter completion requirement or historical approval restoration. Full closed normalSDK/core/independent checks remain pending host context."
    ],
    "members": {
      "jinshu:053:p055": "Named御史jailer at Xuchang, administrator of the prince’s isolation and food deprivation, later executed; all three owned units refer to one continuous jailer.",
      "zizhitongjian:083:p055": "The same named御史holds the prince under guard, receives Sun Lü’s report, deprives him of food and is executed in the matching Jia/Lun sequence. No new person is introduced between these episodes."
    },
